  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Trim and roughly chop green beans.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Boil the kettle.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685c8423971405a9ee1fa56c/step-beeac700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To saucepan, carefully add the boiling water, oyster sauce and garlic stirfry sauce. Stir to combine, then bring to the boil.\n• Add egg noodles and baby broccoli, then cover with a lid. Reduce to a simmer and cook until noodles are tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• In the last minute, gently stir noodles with a fork to separate.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir in baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste. Transfer noodle soup to serving bowls.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685c8423971405a9ee1fa56c/step-2b98eb10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut firm tofu into 1cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine Asian BBQ spice blend, tofu and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685c8423971405a9ee1fa56c/step-38ced120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide noodle soup between bowls.\n• Top noodle soup with tofu and spring onion to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685c8423971405a9ee1fa56c/step-f380d530.jpg"
    }
  ]
